OL,6,G0300 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,7,     FOn the shores of Ballintoy, Co
OL,8,     FAntrim, famed as the Iron Islands
OL,9,     Fin Game of Thrones, Dermot O'Leary
OL,10,     Fjourneys into the Atlantic with a
OL,11,     Ffisherman along one of Ireland's
OL,12,     Fmost dramatic coastlines. He then
OL,13,     Ftravels to Bushmills and steps
OL,14,     Finto the kitchen of acclaimed
OL,15,     Frestaurant Tartine to join chef
OL,16,     FGary Stewart in cooking up a
OL,17,     Fwhiskey-infused rhubarb and
OL,18,     Fcustard. In search of more fine
OL,19,     FIrish whiskey, Dermot joins a
OL,20,     Fstoryteller and whiskey expert for
OL,21,     Fan unforgettable experience at the
OL,22,     FGiant's Causeway
